  Segments:
  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5afad683dfe95de6b6faa9a0d1a907e1, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 2.8808
      Chinese: "这周六，来试试新款磁吸套装吧！"
      English: "Come and try our new magnetic sets this Saturday!"
    - Start: 3.3611
      End: 8.5228
      Chinese: "先和我们一起拼几个模型，再用同样的零件，做出自己的作品。"
      English: "We'll build a few models together, then you can use the same pieces to make something of your own!"
    - Start: 8.983
      End: 13.0643
      Chinese: "也欢迎带上家里的套装，工作人员会帮您试配零件。"
      English: "Bring your own set too! Our staff can help you find matching parts!"
    - Start: 13.6045
      End: 16.3054
      Chinese: "可以慢慢试，我们很想看看您会拼出什么！"
      English: "Take your time! We'd love to see it!"
    Chinese: ""
    English: ""
    GapAfter: 0
